# The Mechanist, Aerial Artisan {2}{U}, 1/3: "Whenever you cast a noncreature spell, create a Clue token." Turn 1: three Moxen (noncreature spells, but cast
# before the Mechanist is on the battlefield) and then the Mechanist and an Ornithopter (creature spells): no Clue. Turn 2 Bot2 casts a Lightning Bolt (an
# opponent's noncreature spell): none for Bot1. Turn 3 Bot1 casts a Lightning Bolt, and a Mox Pearl: one Clue for each (two in all), made as the spell
# is cast, before it resolves - so Bot2 is at 17 only once the first Clue is there too.

